1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,360
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,720
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,560
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,480
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 2=

12
00:01:04,559 --> 00:01:05,400
Madam An,

13
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,239
(Madam Bai, Madam An)
I really didn't break it.

14
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,239
Outrageous.

15
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:12,159
Are you saying I framed you?

16
00:01:12,639 --> 00:01:14,159
(So this is the original owner's
mother.)

17
00:01:14,559 --> 00:01:16,440
(The original owner was so reckless,)

18
00:01:16,639 --> 00:01:19,760
(so why is this mother I inherited
such a pushover?)

19
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,880
Still talking back?

20
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:25,159
It seems your mouth isn't behaving.

21
00:01:25,639 --> 00:01:28,039
(Everlasting Peace & Prosperity)
I'll beat you until you tell the truth.

22
00:01:28,559 --> 00:01:29,400
Get away from her!

23
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:30,840
Since when

24
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,920
in this Grand Tutor's Residence

25
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,800
does a concubine dare to raise a hand
to the principal wife

26
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,280
and throw her weight around?

27
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,039
How dare you hit me?

28
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,000
Yeah, I meant to hit you.

29
00:01:40,199 --> 00:01:42,400
Insolence! You're out of line!

30
00:01:42,679 --> 00:01:43,360
(Everlasting Peace & Prosperity)
Mother.

31
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,760
You're safe now.

32
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:47,519
Since you've finally come back,

33
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:49,559
I'll teach you a proper lesson
right here!

34
00:01:49,559 --> 00:01:50,280
Stop!

35
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,199
May I ask what my princess consort
has done wrong

36
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,239
that you'd resort to private punishment?

37
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,519
(That's quite cool.)

38
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,960
Your Highness,

39
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:07,800
I was disciplining my own family.

40
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:09,760
Quiet!

41
00:02:11,559 --> 00:02:12,639
No more nonsense!

42
00:02:16,239 --> 00:02:17,719
(Grand Tutor Feng)
Your Highness, please forgive me

43
00:02:18,119 --> 00:02:19,920
for failing to welcome you properly.

44
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,280
(Everlasting Peace & Prosperity)

45
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,039
Oh.

46
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,679
I've failed to manage my household

47
00:02:30,679 --> 00:02:33,400
and caused the princess consort
distress.

48
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:34,719
Indeed.

49
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:37,599
Grand Tutor, you should ask
for the full story.

50
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,760
Otherwise,

51
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:43,000
it'll look like I'm throwing
my weight around.

52
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,039
Speak!

53
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,760
What exactly happened?

54
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,159
Madam Bai

55
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:52,800
broke the jade bracelet you gave me.

56
00:02:53,239 --> 00:02:54,639
I only said a few words,

57
00:02:54,679 --> 00:02:56,719
and Weiyue raised a hand to me.

58
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,079
Mother,

59
00:02:58,679 --> 00:03:00,519
did you really break her jade bracelet?

60
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:05,159
(I heard you know a lot about jade.)

61
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:08,239
(So please take a look and tell me
the quality of this jade bracelet.)

62
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:11,400
(Oh no!)

63
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,079
(What do I do now?)

64
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,880
(My husband gave this to me.)

65
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,639
(You're bullying my mother on purpose,
aren't you?)

66
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:20,239
Don't blame my mother, Weiyue.

67
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:23,480
Father gave this bracelet to her.

68
00:03:23,519 --> 00:03:24,840
She treasures it dearly.

69
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,559
That's why she got a little worked up.

70
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:29,599
In the end, it's just an object.

71
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:30,920
Then

72
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:34,519
how do you think this should be settled,
Madam An?

73
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,079
How to settle it?

74
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,320
Everything has a price.

75
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:40,599
Why don't you compensate me
with some silver?

76
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:42,079
No problem. How much?

77
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,039
One thousand taels.

78
00:03:43,239 --> 00:03:44,239
How much again?

79
00:03:46,239 --> 00:03:48,039
One thousand taels?

80
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:50,639
This... This is plain robbery!

81
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,760
Your Highness.

82
00:03:59,199 --> 00:03:59,880
Your Highness,

83
00:04:00,079 --> 00:04:01,519
can you lend me a thousand taels?

84
00:04:01,519 --> 00:04:02,840
I'll pay you back double later.

85
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,360
Please, I'm begging you.

86
00:04:04,679 --> 00:04:07,000
(Weiyue is the daughter-in-law
I've chosen.)

87
00:04:07,079 --> 00:04:08,719
(You can't divorce so easily.)

88
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,840
(You have three days)

89
00:04:11,119 --> 00:04:12,719
(to talk her into coming back.)

90
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,920
Thank you, Your Highness.

91
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,760
Your Highnesses,

92
00:04:23,119 --> 00:04:24,320
my concubine was out of line.

93
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,320
Please don't take it seriously.

94
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,559
Don't take it seriously.

95
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:27,840
Hey,

96
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,880
she said 1,000 taels,
so 1,000 taels it is.

97
00:04:31,039 --> 00:04:32,079
Here's the money.

98
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,199
Madam An, come get it.

99
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,480
My ring!

100
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:45,840
His Highness gave me this ring!

101
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:49,079
Why so impatient, Madam An?

102
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:51,679
This ring is a favorite of mine.

103
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Your Highness!

104
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,559
Oh no.

105
00:04:54,559 --> 00:04:56,400
I didn't even touch you!

106
00:04:58,559 --> 00:05:02,119
Are you saying I framed you on purpose?

107
00:05:02,159 --> 00:05:05,440
Your Highness, you have to
stand up for me.

108
00:05:07,039 --> 00:05:08,280
You little wretch!

109
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,199
Stop!

110
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,639
Stand down.

111
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,599
Princess Consort, well,

112
00:05:17,599 --> 00:05:19,920
how should we settle this?

113
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,400
How should we settle this?

114
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,960
Why don't you just pay me?

115
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,000
Three thousand taels.

116
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,280
How much again?

117
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,559
You're asking an outrageous price!

118
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,599
I picked it up from you, Madam An.

119
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,199
Your Highness,

120
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:35,760
do you think I'm asking too much?

121
00:05:37,559 --> 00:05:40,440
Grand Tutor, you can afford it, right?

122
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:44,280
Yes, Your Highness.

123
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:50,039
Aside from the 1,000 taels
you just paid, Madam An,

124
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,440
you still owe me 2,000 taels.

125
00:05:53,119 --> 00:05:54,559
I only want real silver, not notes.

126
00:05:57,039 --> 00:05:57,960
It's fine.

127
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,519
From now on,

128
00:06:01,159 --> 00:06:03,480
if anyone in this residence
dares to bully my mother again,

129
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:06,039
I will make them pay a terrible price.

130
00:06:16,159 --> 00:06:17,679
Easy, Mother.

131
00:06:29,719 --> 00:06:32,400
You seem different from before.

132
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,519
Well, I've grown up.

133
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,519
(I didn't think much)

134
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,000
(and called you Mother
in the front hall.)

135
00:06:52,599 --> 00:06:54,320
(Then I might as well be your daughter.)

136
00:06:55,039 --> 00:06:56,639
(Back in the 21st century,)

137
00:06:56,639 --> 00:06:57,840
(my parents died young.)

138
00:06:58,239 --> 00:06:59,880
(And now,)

139
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,920
(I finally have a family again.)

140
00:07:04,679 --> 00:07:05,360
Mother.

141
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:09,639
Take this silver.

142
00:07:10,559 --> 00:07:13,679
You'll need silver to deal with everyone
in Prince Rong's Mansion.

143
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:18,840
Today, His Highness didn't seem as harsh
to you as the rumors say.

144
00:07:19,599 --> 00:07:21,239
Now I can rest easy.

145
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,519
Mother...

146
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:24,719
Take it.

147
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,519
Mother,

148
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,079
don't worry.

149
00:07:31,559 --> 00:07:33,960
No one will ever bully you again.

150
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,360
Be good, little one.

151
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,599
- Let's talk.
- We need to talk.

152
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,440
Well, Qingyun,

153
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,280
I've already divorced Mo Yuya.

154
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,320
If you want the position

155
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,239
of princess consort,

156
00:08:08,239 --> 00:08:09,039
I can help you.

157
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,159
What...

158
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,000
What do you mean?

159
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,320
I never had any feelings for him anyway.

160
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:16,560
Besides, the title of princess consort
was yours to begin with.

161
00:08:17,159 --> 00:08:19,840
I'll invite Mo Yuya out tomorrow.

162
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:22,680
Then I'll arrange some time alone
for you two.

163
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:25,279
Whether you go is up to you.

164
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:26,239
(Feng Weiyue,)

165
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,039
(what...)

166
00:08:27,039 --> 00:08:28,720
(What are you playing at?)

167
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:31,119
(You two go ahead
and live happily together,)

168
00:08:31,479 --> 00:08:33,840
(so please stop hurting me,
the side character.)

169
00:08:44,199 --> 00:08:45,880
(Plan on hold.)

170
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,960
(Spring's Tender Grace)
Your Highness, I couldn't catch up.

171
00:08:50,239 --> 00:08:51,359
They got away.

172
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,960
It's not your fault.

173
00:08:53,199 --> 00:08:56,119
Xingzhao Pavilion always does things
flawlessly.

174
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:58,000
But I'm curious, Your Highness.

175
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:01,680
Why is Xingzhao Pavilion
hunting Ms. Feng?

176
00:09:02,479 --> 00:09:04,920
And their pavilion master, Gu Nanke,

177
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:07,079
hasn't come for your life
in three years.

178
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:11,720
Xingzhao Pavilion never stops
until it gets what it wants.

179
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,239
I believe

180
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,199
she's still lying low somewhere.

181
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,560
Is it possible

182
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:22,800
as the rumors in the martial world say,

183
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,319
that Gu Nanke has already...

184
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,800
(Mo Yuya,)

185
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,239
(I failed to poison you to death,)

186
00:09:32,239 --> 00:09:33,960
(but you've still got my poison in you.)

187
00:09:34,319 --> 00:09:36,399
(I will complete my mission.)

188
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,359
Your Highness,

189
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,520
what do we do next

190
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:44,079
to make Xingzhao Pavilion members
show themselves?

191
00:09:50,319 --> 00:09:52,039
Don't we already

192
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,079
have the perfect bait right now?

193
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:17,000
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

194
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:19,520
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

195
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:23,560
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

196
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:26,360
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

197
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:30,360
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

198
00:10:30,920 --> 00:10:33,160
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

199
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:38,760
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

200
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:44,040
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

201
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:47,360
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

202
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:51,160
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

203
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,720
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

204
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,880
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

205
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,600
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

206
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:02,520
♪This love remains unchanged♪

207
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:06,040
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

208
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:10,200
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

209
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:14,320
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

210
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:17,080
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

211
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,980
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

212
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:20,720
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

213
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:24,080
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

214
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:28,400
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

215
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,760
♪I don't regret that vow♪

216
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:34,240
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
